nline or in-store; Sezzle Premium, a paid subscription service that allows its consumers to access large, non-integrated premium merchants; Sezzle Balance, a stored-value product that allows consumers to maintain funds in Sezzle account for use toward eligible purchases or make payments on the Sezzle Platform; and Sezzle Up, an opt-in feature of the Sezzle Platform. In addition, the company offers Long-Term Lending through collaboration with third-party lenders. Sezzle Inc. was incorporated in 2016 and is headquartered in Minneapolis, Minnesota.","employees":201,"website":"https://www.sezzle.com","country":"United States","city":"Minneapolis","officers":[{"name":"Mr. Charles G. Youakim","title":"Co-Founder, Executive Chairman & CEO"},{"name":"Mr. Paul Victor Paradis","title":"Co-Founder, President & Executive Director"},{"name":"Mr. Amin  Sabzivand","title":"Chief Operating Officer"}]},"sector_medians":{"fpe":10.57,"tpe":12.47,"ps":3.447,"pfcf":12.1,"peg":1.33,"pb":1.591,"ev_ebitda":10.61,"rev_growth":0.088,"eps_growth":0.119,"eps_growth_fwd":0.1346,"eps_growth_next":0.1044,"div_yield":0.0226,"roe":0.1284,"roa":0.01568,"de":53.45,"gross_margin":0.2263,"op_margin":0.3704,"profit_margin":0.2565,"current_ratio":1.534},"valuation":[{"k":"fpe","label":"Forward P/E","v":23.48,"sector":10.57,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"tpe","label":"TTM P/E","v":30.08,"sector":12.47,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"ps","label":"Price / Sales","v":9.128,"sector":3.447,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"pfcf","label":"Price / FCF","v":64.71,"sector":12.1,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"peg","label":"PEG","v":0.08,"sector":1.33,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"pb","label":"Price / Book","v":19.12,"sector":1.591,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"de","label":"Debt / Equity (%)","v":36.9,"sector":53.45,"verdict":"Low debt"},{"k":"rev_growth","label":"Revenue growth","v":0.426,"sector":0.088,"verdict":"Strong"},{"k":"eps_growth","label":"EPS growth (last qtr, y/y)","v":0.84,"sector":0.119,"verdict":"Strong"},{